# text = If yo ' could hear them speak , yo'd not be shocked at him ; he's a rare good man , is father -- but oh what he says at times makes me long to die more than ever , for I want to know so many things , and am so tossed about wi ' wonder Poor wench -- poor old wench ,-- I'm loth to vex thee , I am ; but a man mun speak out for the truth , and when I see the world going all wrong at this time o ' day , bothering itself wi ' things it knows nought about , and leaving undone all the things that lie in disorder close at its hand -- why , I say , leave a ' this talk about religion alone , and set to work on what yo ' see and know .
