# text = However I know so little about strikes , and rate of wages , and capital , and labour , that I had better not talk to a political economist like you Nay , the more reason I shall only be too glad to explain to you all that may seem anomalous or mysterious to a stranger ; especially at a time like this , when our doings are sure to be canvassed by every scribbler who can hold a pen Thank you Of course , I shall apply to my father in the first instance for any information he can give me , if I get puzzled with living here amongst this strange society
