# text = That's what they want -- they , who haven't the sense to see that , if we don't get a fair share of the profits to compensate us for our wear and tear here in England , we can move off to some other country ; and that , what with home and foreign competition , we are none of us likely to make above a fair share , and may be thankful enough if we can get that , in an average number of years Can't you get hands from Ireland ?
