# text = You should have waited till I came in , Margaret I tried to persuade her I don't know She ought to see him if she wishes it so much , for I believe it would do her much more good than all the doctor's medicine ,-- and , perhaps , set her up altogether ; but the danger to him , I'm afraid , is very great All these years since the mutiny , papa Yes ; it is necessary , of course , for government to take very stringent measures for the repression of offences against authority , more particularly in the navy , where a commanding officer needs to be surrounded in his men's eyes with a vivid consciousness of all the power there is at home to back him , and take up his cause , and avenge any injuries offered to him , if need be .
