# text = And then -- oh , Mr . Bell ! now comes the bad part A police inspector came and taxed me with having been the companion of the young man , whose push or blow had occasioned Leonards' death ; that was a false accusation , you know , but we had not heard that Fred had sailed , he might still be in London and liable to be arrested on this false charge , and his identity with the Lieutenant Hale , accused of causing that mutiny , discovered , he might be shot ; all this flashed through my mind , and I said it was not me .
